      "en": "**http status** codes: 2xx success (200 OK, 201 created, 204 no body); 3xx redirect; 4xx your mistake (400 bad data, 401 not signed in, 403 forbidden, 404 not found, 409 conflict, 422 validation failed, 429 too many); 5xx the server’s mistake (500, 502, 503). The first digit tells you whether to retry or fix your request."
